{"symbol":"APOLLOPIPE","yahoo":"APOLLOPIPE.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE126J01016","sme":null,"name":"Apollo Pipes Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.apollopipes.com","about":"Apollo Pipes Limited manufactures and trades in polyvinyl chloride (PVC) pipes and fittings in India. The company offers cPVC, uPVC, and PPR-C plumbing systems; uPVC pressure pipes and fittings, and garden pipes; HDPE PLB duct pipes and MDPE and HDPE gas piping system; SWR drainage system, underground drainage system, and DWC pipes; and agri pipes and fitting, HDPE pipes, coils, and sprinkler systems. It also provides underground drainage uPVC column Pipes, and casing pipes; water tanks, solvent cement, and kitchen sink. In addition, the company offers bath fittings, which include faucets, showers, health faucets, cistern, seat covers, accessories, and allied products. It provides its products to plumbing, agriculture, sewerage, water management, construction, fenestration industry, infrastructure, borewell system solutions, water storage solutions, water supply solutions, bath fittings solutions, industrial piping solutions, and telecom ducting industries. Apollo Pipes Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Noida, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T10:02:23+00:00","quote":{"price":511.45,"prevClose":510.5,"marketCap":2246.26,"high52":668.8,"low52":252.1,"pe":null,"bookValue":185.96,"dividendRate":0.7,"roe":null,"shares":4.3919,"insiders":69.25,"institutions":8.58},"prices":{"dates":["2019-11-11","2019-11-13","2019-11-14","2019-11-15","2019-11-18","2019-11-19","2019-11-20","2019-11-21","2019-11-22","2019-11-25","2019-11-26","2019-11-27","2019-11-28","2019-11-29","2019-12-02","2019-12-03","2019-12-04","2019-12-05","2019-12-06","2019-12-09","2019-12-10","2019-12-11","2019-12-12","2019-12-13","2019-12-16","2019-12-17","2019-12-18","2019-12-19","2019-12-20","2019-12-23","2019-12-24","2019-12-26","2019-12-27","2019-12-30","201